anniversary of \\\"Who Wants To Be A Millionaire,\\\" Jimmy Kimmel steps into prime time as host of a special run of episodes featuring celebrity contestants playing for charity.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5MUXbJPZigwX0zEjhEKpOSQC9r3.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2020-04-08\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"In the Hot Seat: Eric Stonestreet and Will Forte\",\"overview\":\"The 20th anniversary event kicks off with celebrity contestant Eric Stonestreet playing for Building Hope for Autism and Will Forte playing for The Pangea Network.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8llTZm7EcuI4ppnqRzzkgfZB8a1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-08\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"In the Hot Seat: Will Forte and Nikki Glaser\",\"overview\":\"Will Forte continues his winning streak this week in support of The Pangea Network. Nikki Glaser will play for Rescue the Birds, including a never-before-seen historic moment in the show’s 20-year history.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dgLlWt7b48GPmrvAgNWePRgmAx4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-15\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"In the Hot Seat: Nikki Glaser, Jane Fonda and Anthony Anderson\",\"overview\":\"Nikki Glaser continues her winning streak for Rescue the Birds. Jane Fonda takes the stage in support of her charity Fire Drill Friday’s, and Anthony Anderson plays for The Anderson Family Foundation.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zLXeWzCfOCU9nIL1R5K9lZCmTXn.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-22\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"In the Hot Seat: Anthony Anderson, Ike Barinholtz and Hannibal Buress\",\"overview\":\"Anthony Anderson continues his streak playing for The Anderson Family Foundation. Ike Barinholtz jumps in the hot seat playing for Uplift Family Services, and Hannibal Buress plays for Melvina Masterminds.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nVT2qFE1b8ziX